From: jgrizon
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:23:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] shader: VICTORY_BARRIER_LDS leaves group barriers TGSM-only
 (off by default)

D3DMetal on AGX M1 fails to create the compute pipeline that uses the fence
our dx.op.barrier modes become ("Encountered unlowered function call to
air.fence_"). A console s_barrier orders group-shared memory, not global
memory by itself (the title's waits do that), so the device (2) and texture
(8) bits are not needed for it. With VICTORY_BARRIER_LDS=1 both the s_barrier
path and the halves exchange barrier emit mode 1 instead of 1|8 and 1|2|8;
default emission is unchanged.

Ported from paveledits/ScarlettMac runtime-preview/checkpoint/patches/0008-shader-VICTORY_BARRIER_LDS-leaves-group-barriers-TGS.patch

Generated by Mistral Vibe.
Co-Authored-By: Mistral Vibe <vibe@mistral.ai>
